      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/a9a28c/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-08-28T06:24:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>&nbsp;you can not use Wrest the Mind on a villain,&nbsp; this is corrected in the Enhanced Edition and also in the errata.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>However,&nbsp; generally speaking,&nbsp; yes, the target under WtM is a viable option for redirecting damage to.&nbsp;&nbsp; (IE:&nbsp; Yes, you can make things attack themselves).&nbsp;</p>",
